# shellcheck configuration for LibreChat YunoHost package scripts.
#
# These codes are YunoHost-framework false positives or acceptable hygiene
# notes, not defects; disabling them keeps the lint gate meaningful (real
# errors and other warnings still fail) without churning verified scripts:
#   SC2154 - "referenced but not assigned": YNH injects app/install_dir/
#            data_dir/domain/admin_email/db_user/etc. as environment globals
#            from the package install/upgrade manifest before sourcing.
#   SC2034 - "appears unused": vars read by YNH helpers at runtime.
#   SC2086 - "double quote" info: pervasive, idiomatic in YNH helper calls
#            (ynh_* take tokenized options); not a correctness issue.
#   SC2164 - "pushd/popd without || exit": defensive-hygiene warning in
#            config helpers; an iniative cd failure is caught elsewhere.
#   SC1090/SC1091 - cannot follow external source (_common.sh, ynh_* helpers)
#            not present in the CI runner.
disable=SC2154,SC2034,SC2086,SC2164,SC1090,SC1091
